WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.947
Welcome. If you have never written code,
start here.

00:00:03.947 --> 00:00:07.779
Code is a set of instructions that tells a
computer what to do.

00:00:07.779 --> 00:00:10.774
A website keeps those instructions in files.

00:00:10.774 --> 00:00:13.897
You do not have to write them yourself to
begin this lesson.

00:00:13.897 --> 00:00:17.206
Claude Code can help read and change a
project.

00:00:17.206 --> 00:00:21.141
You describe the result you want, and you
check the result it produces.

00:00:21.141 --> 00:00:25.646
In an ordinary chat, you might ask for advice
and receive an explanation.

00:00:25.646 --> 00:00:29.988
Here, you will eventually let Claude work on
files in a folder you choose.
